/*
  SubscribeCard.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0255 · SubscribeCard (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `SubscribeCard` resolves (table "SubscribeCard") lives here with its web
  English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master
  catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each
  parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The web source (features/system/components/status/SubscribeCard.tsx) is a
  presentational component that renders English literals directly (its only
  external dependency is the router `<Link>`). Those literals are promoted here to
  keys with byte-equal English values so the Swift sources hold no hardcoded
  prose. The second group backs the native-only chrome — the VoiceOver copy and
  the loading / empty / error / connectivity states the prompt requires.
*/

